+## 122. Lean-checked Poisson vertex algebra of pure SU(2) N=2 operators
+
+**Source:** Ahsan Z. Khan, “Lie Algebra Cohomology and Seiberg-Witten Theory.” arXiv:2611.29713, 22 November 2026. The algebra of perturbative holomorphic-topological local operators of pure \(\mathcal N=2\) SU(2) gauge theory is the Poisson vertex algebra generated by a Virasoro element \(X\) of central charge zero and an odd primary \(Y\) of weight three subject only to \(X^2=0\). Equivalently, relative Lie algebra cohomology \(H^*(\mathfrak{sl}_2[z,w]/(w^2),\mathfrak{sl}_2)\). Complete Lean 4 formalization of the main isomorphism (~121k lines, only standard axioms propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound). https://github.com/qqz3ro/pure-su2-pva
